---
description: React, MUI, i18n, state, and API patterns for produza-frontend
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# React and TypeScript

- Functional components; type exported props and public hook/API return values.
- Custom hooks: `use` prefix. Context consumers: `useSomething` matching the provider domain.
- Respect `react-refresh/only-export-components`: avoid mixing non-component exports with components in the same file unless the ESLint rule allows it.
- Separate types and interfaces from Components files, use a separated file for it.

# MUI

- Import from **`@mui/material/ComponentName`** (not barrel `@mui/material` for everything) for tree-shaking.
- Prefer **`sx`** for small one-off layout; when styling grows or repeats, extract **`styled(...)`** into colocated **`*.styled.tsx`**.
- Colors: always **`theme.palette.produza.*`** (and standard MUI palette when appropriate). New hues → add tokens in **`produzaTokens.ts`** first, then consume—never paste brand hex into feature/shared styled files.
- Avoid light/dark hex forks in components; put both values on the light/dark token objects instead.
- Global look-and-feel: **`src/theme`** + **`ThemeContext`**—do not call `createTheme` inside pages or features; extend the theme factory when new design tokens are needed.

# Components and structure

- Prefer **single responsibility**: thin route/page components, presentational children, and small hooks (`use*` in a `hooks/` folder per feature when logic is reused or keeps JSX short).
- Avoid oversized files: split tables, forms, and shells into focused components instead of one long module.

# i18n

- All user-visible strings go through **react-i18next** (`useTranslation`) and locale files under **`src/i18n`**. No hardcoded UI sentences in components.

# State

- **Zustand**: prefer focused stores per domain (`useAuthStore`, etc.) over one oversized file as the app grows.

# API

- HTTP: use **`apiClient`** from `@/core/api` with paths relative to **`config.apiBaseUrl`** (`@/core/config/env`). Do not duplicate raw `fetch` + base URL assembly in UI files.
- Type responses with generics or types from **`@/core/types`**.

# Quality

- Match existing **ESLint** and **Prettier** setup; add or update tests under `src/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}` when behavior changes.
